[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14341.189, "timestamp": "03:59:01", "text": "这。最后，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14343.75, "timestamp": "03:59:03", "text": "色彩要丰富，但又要护眼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14347.83, "timestamp": "03:59:07", "text": "是的，这件事是我做的。笨蛋，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14350.71, "timestamp": "03:59:10", "text": "我花了几个月的时间？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14355.11, "timestamp": "03:59:15", "text": "尽管？她于6月7日发表了这番言论。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14358.15, "timestamp": "03:59:18", "text": "我花了整整十二月才做出叠加层。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14369.83, "timestamp": "03:59:29", "text": "简直难以置信。简直难以置信"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14372.389, "timestamp": "03:59:32", "text": "尽管。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14377.189, "timestamp": "03:59:37", "text": "就像我做的这个呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14381.83, "timestamp": "03:59:41", "text": "呃，这是我做的，呃，这是我做的，我计划好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14385.03, "timestamp": "03:59:45", "text": "就像六月、七月、八月那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14386.63, "timestamp": "03:59:46", "text": "时期"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14388.469, "timestamp": "03:59:48", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14391.75, "timestamp": "03:59:51", "text": "我再也没回去做那些事了，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14395.59, "timestamp": "03:59:55", "text": "就像 h"}]